DESCRIPTION:Python project for Declarative Automation Bundles; deps (PyPI/wheels/source) on serverless/pipeline/bundle; UDFs Pandas/Python/SQL + UC functions; Lakeflow Declarative Pipelines + Auto Loader; streaming table vs materialized view. Drill 15-20 q.
