SUMMARY:DE Pro D3 - S1 Code part 2 (net-new)
DESCRIPTION:Structured Streaming stateful (watermarks/output modes/foreachBatch/checkpoints exactly-once); AUTO CDC + SCD Type 1/2 via stored_as_scd_type; SS vs LDP; control flow If-Else/For Each; serverless compute (performance mode); testing assertDataFrameEqual/assertSchemaEqual. Drill 15-20 q.
