DTSTAMP:20260925T120000Z
DTSTART:20260928T120000Z
DTEND:20260928T150000Z
SUMMARY:DE Pro D4 - S5 Cost & Performance (15%)
DESCRIPTION:Managed tables + Predictive Optimization + Liquid Clustering; choose deletion vectors vs LC vs CLUSTER BY AUTO; Delta cache; CDF row-level; query profile (data skipping/join/shuffle); LC vs partitioning/ZORDER. Drill 15-20 q + Query Profiler on Free Edition.
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT30M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:DE Pro D4
END:VALARM
