UID:cert-de-pro-dia05@rodsant
DTSTAMP:20260925T120000Z
DTSTART:20260929T220000Z
DTEND:20260930T003000Z
SUMMARY:DE Pro D5 - S2 Ingestion (12%) (net-new)
DESCRIPTION:Formats incl. Iceberg; message buses (Kafka/Kinesis/Pub-Sub) + cloud storage; incremental CDC with Delta OR Iceberg; Lakeflow Connect (CDC from SQL Server/MySQL/Postgres); OpenSharing D2D/D2O + Clean Rooms; Lakehouse Federation with governance. Drill 15-20 q.
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT30M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:DE Pro D5
END:VALARM
