DTEND:20261001T003000Z
SUMMARY:DE Pro D6 - S3 Data Manipulation (12%) (net-new)
DESCRIPTION:Window functions/joins/aggregations (Spark SQL + PySpark); VARIANT (parse_json, variant_get, colon-path); AI functions (ai_query) for inference in pipeline; data quality expectations in LDP (quarantine/drop/fail). Drill 15-20 q.
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT30M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:DE Pro D6
END:VALARM
