UID:cert-de-pro-dia07@rodsant
DTSTAMP:20260925T120000Z
DTSTART:20261001T220000Z
DTEND:20261002T010000Z
SUMMARY:DE Pro D7 - S4 Monitor + S8 Debug/Deploy + Practice Exam #2
DESCRIPTION:S4: system tables (billing/compute/access/lakeflow); REST/CLI/SDK; event logs; Lakehouse alerts; Jobs UI/API. S8: Spark UI/logs/query profiles; job repairs + parameter overrides; Declarative Automation Bundles; Git folders CI/CD. COMPLETE PRACTICE EXAM #2 timed - update tracker.
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT30M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:DE Pro D7 - Practice Exam #2
