UID:cert-de-pro-dia08@rodsant
DTSTAMP:20260925T120000Z
DTSTART:20261002T220000Z
DTEND:20261003T003000Z
SUMMARY:DE Pro D8 - S6 Security + S7 Governance + S9 Modeling
DESCRIPTION:S6: least-privilege ACLs; ABAC with governed tags (row filters/column masks at scale); anonymization; PII masking batch+streaming; data purging (GDPR). S7: UC tags/comments; UC permission inheritance. S9: Delta/Iceberg layout; dimensional + Materialized Views + UC Metric Views. Drill 20 q.
